                                "sense_id": "3f42aece-d24b-3cec-a90c-70b0d4978425",
                                "text": "After a time she touched the bell, with great caution; the cook appeared, to whom she gave a slip of paper, on which the woman vanished, leaving the little pedlar of small wares standing on the steps, where she had already placed her basket,..."
                            },
                            {
